            "id": "monica-application-routing",
            "text": "Before designing, implementing, refactoring, or reviewing a Monica application, load $monica-application and the repository-designated project application specification skill, then read the affected architecture and BuildingBlock references. For business UI also load monica-application-ui; the same project specification owns presentation and backend.",
