                "title": "应用研发规范",
                "description": "开发前加载共享应用规范与项目规范。"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "monica-application-specification-evolution",
            "text": "Compose existing Building Blocks and documented capabilities within their approved contracts. Use monica-application's specification evolution rules only for a concrete architectural gap or rule change that composition cannot resolve; identify that gap before requesting a scoped human decision. Reuse existing explicit approval within its agreed scope.",
            "labels": {
              "en-US": {
                "title": "Confirm architecture changes",
                "description": "Reuse existing capabilities; confirm changes to architectural rules."
              },
